LifePulse bundles icon artwork from Bootstrap Icons (https://icons.getbootstrap.com),
copyright (c) 2019-2024 The Bootstrap Authors, also under the MIT License. The
sixty glyphs used are embedded in app/templates/_icons.html and rebuilt by
tools/build_icon_sprite.py.

LifePulse is a screening tool, not a medical device. Nothing in it is a
diagnosis, and the "no warranty" paragraph above applies to its health
estimates as much as to its code.
